<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology/0.6.0> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> "Semantic layer integrating wildlife pathogen, vector, phenology and climate observations from ecological monitoring networks, modelled on SOSA."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> "Pollard, B. (2026). NEON-EPN Ontology, version 0.6.0. https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology" .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-09-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> _:genid1 .
_:genid1 <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name> "Bryant Pollard" .
_:genid1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person> .
<http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An OWL ontology for wildlife pathogen surveillance, vector abundance and plant phenology observed across a continental ecological monitoring network. Host-pathogen assays, drag-cloth vector sampling, phenophase checks and sensor telemetry are modelled as specialisations of the W3C SOSA observation pattern over a spatial hierarchy of domains, sites and plots, so that products sharing no identifier in their published form become jointly queryable. Observations record the contributing network, allowing records from more than one monitoring programme to be integrated without losing provenance."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-09-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language> "en" .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-09-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> _:genid2 .
_:genid2 <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name> "Clemson University" .
_:genid2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Organization> .
<http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Organization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/rights> "Released under CC BY 4.0. Underlying NEON and USA-NPN data are also CC BY 4.0."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://www.neonscience.org/> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://www.usanpn.org/> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "NEON-EPN Ontology: National Ecological Observatory Network Eco-Pathogen Network"@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "neonepn" .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#" .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Semantic layer (TBox) for the NEON-EPN capstone project. Models NEON\nhost-pathogen sampling events and continuous climate sensor telemetry over a dynamic\nspatial hierarchy, as specializations of the W3C SOSA observation pattern. Serves as the\nsingle schema that governs RDF ingestion (Stage 2), SHACL validation (Stage 3), SPARQL\nserving (Stage 4), and the flattened Temporal Graph Benchmark export (Stage 5).\n\nReuse policy: SOSA is imported in full - Observation, Sampling, FeatureOfInterest,\nSensor, resultTime and hasResult are all load-bearing here. Everything else is\nsoft-referenced by IRI (MIREOT-style) rather than imported: GeoSPARQL, QUDT,\nNCBITaxon, ENVO, the Plant Phenology Ontology (PPO, CC BY 3.0), and the three\nOWL-Time terms below, and PROV-O for the contributing network. Phenophase\nindividuals carry skos:closeMatch links to PPO, which was designed to\naccommodate both NEON and USA-NPN status-based monitoring; that shared\nvocabulary is what allows observations from the two networks to be queried\ntogether without a bespoke crosswalk. Importing OWL-Time in full\npulled in Duration, GeneralDurationDescription, DateTimeDescription, TRS and a dozen\nother classes that no instance data ever used, tripling the apparent size of the\nmodel for no benefit."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://github.com/BryantPollard/neon-epn> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.neonscience.org/> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#priorVersion> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology/0.5.0> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "0.6.0" .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ppo.owl> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasGeneratedBy> _:genid3 .
_:genid3 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "NEON-EPN ontology development"@en .
_:genid3 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Developed against seven competency questions, formalised in OWL, and evaluated by competency-question coverage, structural metrics, annotation coverage and a SHACL gate over the instantiated graph."@en .
_:genid3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology> <https://schema.org/codeRepository> <https://github.com/BryantPollard/neon-epn> .
