# 
# https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#detectedAt
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#detectedAt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#detectedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#PathogenTaxon> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#detectedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#SpatialUnit> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#detectedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Asserted pathogen-place detection edge: the pathogen taxon was detected in a vector sample collected at this spatial unit. Materialized from each TickPathogenAssay whose hasAssayResult is Detected. This is the vector-borne counterpart of detectedIn and the second link-prediction target of the temporal graph."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#detectedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "detected at"@en .
# 
# https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#detectedIn
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#detectedIn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#detectedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#PathogenTaxon> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#detectedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#HostIndividual> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#detectedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Asserted pathogen-host detection edge: the pathogen taxon was detected in the host individual. Materialized during Stage 2 from each PathogenAssay whose hasAssayResult is Detected; this is the primary positive edge type of the temporal graph and the main link-prediction target."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#detectedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "detected in"@en .
# 
# https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#expressedAt
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#expressedAt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#expressedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#Phenophase> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#expressedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#SpatialUnit> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#expressedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Asserted phenophase-place edge: this phenophase was observed expressed at this spatial unit. Materialized from observations whose status is Expressed. Densely labelled, like observedAt, and it supplies the seasonal timing against which vector activity and pathogen detection can be compared."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#expressedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "expressed at"@en .
# 
# https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#fromDragSample
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#fromDragSample> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#fromDragSample> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#VectorOccurrence> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#fromDragSample> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#DragSample> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#fromDragSample> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links an identified tick occurrence back to the bout that collected it, so that effort and sampled area remain recoverable."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#fromDragSample> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "from drag sample"@en .
# 
# https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hasAssayResult
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hasAssayResult> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hasAssayResult> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hasAssayResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#PathogenTest> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hasAssayResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#AssayResult> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hasAssayResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The single outcome of an assay, drawn from the closed AssayResult value set."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hasAssayResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has assay result"@en .
# 
# https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hasPhenophaseStatus
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hasPhenophaseStatus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hasPhenophaseStatus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hasPhenophaseStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#PhenophaseObservation> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hasPhenophaseStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#PhenophaseStatus> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hasPhenophaseStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a phenophase observation to its outcome. Functional: a single check yields one status."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hasPhenophaseStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has phenophase status"@en .
# 
# https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hostOf
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hostOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hostOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#detectedIn> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hostOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of detectedIn: relates a host individual to a pathogen found in it."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#hostOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "host of"@en .
# 
# https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#nearFieldSite
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#nearFieldSite> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#nearFieldSite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ObservationSite> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#nearFieldSite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#FieldSite> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#nearFieldSite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Asserted proximity between an external observation site and a NEON field site, materialized when the two lie within a stated distance. Deliberately NOT withinSpatialUnit: an external site is not contained by a NEON site, and treating proximity as containment would license false inference through the transitive spatial hierarchy."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#nearFieldSite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "near field site"@en .
# 
# https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedAt
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedAt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#VectorTaxon> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#SpatialUnit> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Asserted vector-presence edge: this tick species was collected at this spatial unit. Materialized from drag samples in which the taxon was identified. Unlike detectedIn and detectedAt, which record rare pathogen detections, this relation is densely labelled - roughly half of all bouts find the target taxa - which makes it a well-powered companion task on the same graph."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "observed at"@en .
# 
# https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedByNetwork
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedByNetwork> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedByNetwork> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedByNetwork> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Observation> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedByNetwork> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ObservationNetwork> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedByNetwork> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The programme whose protocol produced this observation. Present on every observation once more than one source is integrated, so that provenance survives the merge."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedByNetwork> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "observed by network"@en .
# 
# https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedPhenophase
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedPhenophase> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedPhenophase> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedPhenophase> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#PhenophaseObservation> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedPhenophase> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#Phenophase> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedPhenophase> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The phenophase being checked. Functional, and drawn from the closed set NEON records."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#observedPhenophase> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "observed phenophase"@en .
# 
# https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofPlantTaxon
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofPlantTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofPlantTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofPlantTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#PlantIndividual> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofPlantTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#PlantTaxon> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofPlantTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The species of a marked plant. Functional, and shared across both contributing networks so that taxa are not duplicated per source."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofPlantTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "of plant taxon"@en .
# 
# https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofTaxon
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#HostIndividual> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#HostTaxon> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links an individual organism to its species-level taxon."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "of taxon"@en .
# 
# https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofVectorTaxon
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofVectorTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofVectorTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofVectorTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#VectorOccurrence> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofVectorTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#VectorTaxon> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofVectorTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The tick species identified in a drag-cloth collection. Functional: one occurrence records one taxon."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ofVectorTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "of vector taxon"@en .
