<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#testedForPathogen> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#PathogenTest> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#testedForPathogen> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#PathogenTaxon> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#testedForPathogen> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The single pathogen taxon targeted by an assay."@en .
