# https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#withinSpatialUnit
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#withinSpatialUnit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#withinSpatialUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#sfWithin> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#withinSpatialUnit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#TransitiveProperty> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#withinSpatialUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#SpatialUnit> .
