<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#withinSpatialUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Transitive containment along the NEON spatial hierarchy (plot within site within domain). Sub-property of GeoSPARQL sfWithin so spatial reasoners interoperate."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#withinSpatialUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "within spatial unit"@en .
