<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#PlantIndividual> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A marked plant observed repeatedly through the season, identified by the contributing network's individual identifier. Unlike a host animal it is sessile, so its location is fixed and it is revisited on a schedule rather than recaptured by chance. Identifiers are network-scoped: a NEON individualID and a USA-NPN individual_id may collide numerically and are kept in separate IRI spaces."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#PlantIndividual> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Plant individual"@en .
