<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#NEON> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Continental-scale observatory operated by Battelle under NSF cooperative agreement. Observations are made by trained technicians on fixed plots to a published protocol."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#NEON> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "National Ecological Observatory Network"@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#NEON> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.neonscience.org/> .
