# https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#NotDetected
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#NotDetected> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#NotDetected> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#AssayResult> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#NotDetected> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The assay was performed and did not find the pathogen. An observed absence, not a missing value: this is what makes prevalence computable, since it supplies the denominator."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#NotDetected> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "not detected"@en .
# 
# https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#NotExpressed
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#NotExpressed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#NotExpressed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#PhenophaseStatus> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#NotExpressed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The plant was checked and the phenophase was not observable. An observed absence, not a missing value; corresponds to PPO's 'absent' traits, e.g. 'open flower absent' (PPO:0002632)."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#NotExpressed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Not expressed"@en .
# 
