<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#OpenFlowers> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#OpenFlowers> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#Phenophase> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#OpenFlowers> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Aligned to 'open flower present' (PPO:0002333). The closest correspondence in the set."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#OpenFlowers> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Open flowers"@en .
