<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#OpenPollenCones> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#Phenophase> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#OpenPollenCones> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Aligned to 'open microsporangiate strobilus' (PPO:0001047). PPO offers no paired presence trait for pollen cones, so the match is to the structure class itself."@en .
