<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#PathogenPresence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The observable property measured by a pathogen assay: presence/absence of a target pathogen in a host individual or its sample."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#PathogenPresence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "pathogen presence"@en .
