<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#Precipitation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bulk precipitation from the weighing gauge (DP1.00044.001), which replaced the deprecated DP1.00006.001 in October 2025."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#Precipitation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "precipitation"@en .
