<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#RelativeHumidity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relative humidity. Capacitive sensors read slightly above 100 percent in fog and frost; values to 105 percent are retained with a warning rather than discarded."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#RelativeHumidity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "relative humidity"@en .
# 
