<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#SoilTemperature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Soil temperature. Declared for completeness; NEON soil arrays sit 9.5 km or more from the nearest drag plot, so the product is not ingested."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#SoilTemperature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "soil temperature"@en .
