<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#StatusUncertain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The observer could not determine the status. Excluded from derived timing measures."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#StatusUncertain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Uncertain"@en .
# 
# https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#USANPN
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#USANPN> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#USANPN> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#ObservationNetwork> .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#USANPN> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Volunteer phenology monitoring through the Nature's Notebook programme, coordinated by the USA-NPN National Coordinating Office. Observers are dispersed and self-selected, and the coordinating office has limited ability to verify individual observer skill, so a single record carries less assurance than a NEON record while the aggregate covers far more of the country."@en .
<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#USANPN> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "USA National Phenology Network"@en .
