<https://bryantpollard.github.io/neon-epn/ontology#UnidentifiedHostTaxon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Sentinel taxon for captured animals NEON recorded without a usable species identification (an animal escaping before identification, or an incomplete record). Modelling this explicitly keeps the capture and any assay in the graph while making the taxonomic uncertainty visible, rather than silently dropping the animal."@en .
